From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agent3 <agent3@localhost>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 15:05:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: build only stm32mp257f-dk

The custom DTS dir trims SCMI protocol nodes out of the shared
stm32mp25 dtsi files as part of the OP-TEE removal migration. Other
ST boards (stm32mp257f-ev1, stm32mp235f-dk, ...) still reference the
deleted scmi_clk/scmi_devpd labels and would fail dtc phandle checks,
so stop building their dtbs: this image only ever targets the
STM32MP257F-DK.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/Makefile | 5 +----
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/Makefile
index 111111111..222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/Makefile
@@ -1,6 +1,3 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_STM32) += \
-	stm32mp215f-dk.dtb \
-	stm32mp235f-dk.dtb \
-	stm32mp257f-dk.dtb \
-	stm32mp257f-ev1.dtb
+	stm32mp257f-dk.dtb
--
2.43.0
